Great game!
War with land, water and air units. It runs in several old pcs, while on newer it rocks.
Pros:
+ multiple units;
+ Smart and challenging AI, they are not sitting ducks;
+ You can play alone or with others;
Cons:
- You get easily choosing a few prefered units and stick with them;
- Hard AI seems to be able to do things we can't as moving multiple units at the same time with living moves, you need to see that;
- A large but limited number of scenarios, I got a few 6x6 choices and that was it, no ramdom assignment and you can use corners to avoid multiple fronts;
Go for it at full price, be happy!

